(
    title: "Golf",
    description: Some("A nine-hole, par-36 round played from overhead. You have a single club: hold the button to wind up a longer backswing for more power, and set your aim by walking the golfer around the ball. Water costs a penalty stroke, trees knock the ball back, and sand and rough swallow it and sap its momentum. Reach the green and the view zooms in for the putt."),
